{"ref":"BDB, עֲזָרָה","hw":"עֲזָרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֲזָרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> appar. <strong>enclosure</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>ledge surrounding</em> Ezekiel’s altar; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳ הַתַּחְתּוֹנָה</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳ הַקְּטַנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.14\">Ez 43:14</a>, below <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳ הַגְּדוֹלָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.14\">14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳</span> alone v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:20\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.19\">45:19</a> (v. Comm.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  outer <em>court</em> of temple, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳ הַגְּדֹלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.9\">2 Ch 4:9</a>; with doors v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 4:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.4.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.13\">6:13</a> (v. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָצֵר\" href=\"/BDB,_חָצֵר\", dir=\"rtl\">חָצֵר</a> <strong>3 b</strong>, and on <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> in Herod’s temple Now<sup>Arch. ii. 78 ff.</sup>).","next":"BDB, עַזָּתִי²","prev":"BDB, עזר"}